# Water-bundled terminal database entry.
#
# Named "alacritty" because Water embeds alacritty_terminal and its
# `tty::setup_env` selects TERM=alacritty when this entry is discoverable
# through TERMINFO_DIRS. Derived from the official alacritty terminfo
# (https://github.com/alacritty/alacritty, Apache-2.0) with one intentional
# deviation: `clear` appends CSI 3 J so scrollback is erased together with
# the viewport. Without 3 J, alacritty's ESC[2J semantics push the screen
# into history, so `clear` leaves the command line and prompt ghosted one
# row above the fresh viewport (kitty ships the same 2J+3J combination).
#
# Compile with: tic -x -o assets/terminfo assets/terminfo/alacritty.src.terminfo

alacritty|alacritty terminal emulator,
    use=xterm-256color,
    AX,
    XT,
    E3=\E[3J,
    clear=\E[H\E[2J\E[3J,
    Smulx=\E[4\:%p1%dm,
    Sync=\E[?2026%?%p1%{1}%-%tl%eh%;,
    Cs=\E]12;%p1%s\007,
    Cr=\E]112\007,
    Ms=\E]52;%p1%s;%p2%s\007,
    Se=\E[2 q,
    Ss=\E[%p1%d q,
    kxIN=\E[I,
    kxOUT=\E[O,
